        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Older lady, stoic and under-reporting discomfort, with mild guarding of the right shoulder."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder inspection and palpation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild supraspinatus and infraspinatus bulk reduction compared with the left. No deformity or erythema. Tender over the greater tuberosity and anterolateral shoulder; acromioclavicular joint non-tender."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Active abduction approximately 70° and flexion approximately 90°, limited by pain and weakness. External rotation active range painful. Passive range near full with mild end-range pain; no capsular pattern."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Shoulder power"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right versus left: abduction 3/5 with pain; external rotation 3–4/5 with pain; internal rotation 4/5. Left 5/5 throughout."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder special tests"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Jobe positive, painful and weak; resisted external rotation positive; Hawkins positive; Neer positive; lift-off mildly weak; O'Brien equivocal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological, neurovascular, and cervical examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Neurovascularly intact; pulses present, capillary refill under 2 seconds, sensation C5–T1 intact, reflexes symmetrical. Full neck range of motion; Spurling negative; no new focal neurological deficit."
      }
    },
